OL,3,GNEWSAHousekeeper cleared of stealing
OL,4,Aprincess's jewels
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe court heard police found the
OL,7,Fprincess's wedding ring, a pair of
OL,8,Fearrings and a jewelled metal necklace
OL,9,Fduring a search of Taborda Henao's home
OL,10,Fin Fulham.
